Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:40:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Restore the idle timer reset when living entities take damage

Keep the Paper idle timer reset after the Purpur damage override so hurt mobs retain normal despawn and AI timing.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/LivingEntity.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/LivingEntity.java
index cc18abf176c671905f769d8fb1930168db4d6d28..3935bdc4557839a9fec1bc18f6df572bcded8eae 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/LivingEntity.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/LivingEntity.java
@@ -1548,7 +1548,8 @@ public abstract class LivingEntity extends Entity implements Attackable, Waypoin
                 }
             }
         }
-        // Purpur end - One Punch Man!this.noActionTime = 0;
+        // Purpur end - One Punch Man!
+        this.noActionTime = 0;
         if (damage < 0.0F) {
             damage = 0.0F;
         }
